<title>Why do I get a black screen when I start the Cidelsa Arcade Game Console?</title>
<body>

<h1>Why do I get a black screen when I start the Cidelsa Arcade Game Console?</h1>

<p>
The Cidelsa emulator requires a game ROM to run. Only three official game ROMs are currently known: <strong>Altair</strong>, <strong>Destroyer</strong> (two sets) and <strong>Draco</strong>. If you know of any others, I would be interested in testing them.
</p>

</body>
